- Melee
-- RoF: 1.1x
- Lightsaber (Yellow/Cyan)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (3)
-- Special Damage: 1.25x
-- EX Saber Throw (1) ^3[CS1]
--- Damage: 50

^5Force Powers:
